(4*xi)/h)*gammas[1] + gammas[2]))/xi - (h*((5*ur + alphas[2])*gammas[1] + \
3*alphas[1]*gammas[2]))/(5.*coords(0));\\nsourceTerm(6)=(-5*R*(utheta + \
gammas[1] + (1 + (12*xi)/h)*gammas[2]))/xi + (h*(7*alphas[1]*gammas[1] - \
3*(7*ur + alphas[2])*gammas[2]))/(21.*coords(0))))\"\>"], "Output",
