3];\\nJacobianTheta(8,6)=0;\\nJacobianTheta(8,7)=(2*(gammas[1] + \
gammas[3]))/5.;\\nJacobianTheta(8,8)=utheta + gammas[2]/3.))\"\>"], "Output",
