5*alphas[3]*(11*gammas[1] - 3*gammas[3]) + 330*alphas[1]*gammas[3]) - \
5*h*(1001*ur + 130*alphas[2] + 81*alphas[4])*gammas[4])/(5005.*coords(0))))\"\
