alpha6))/self.slip_length\\nS[7] = (-13*self.viscosity*(um + alpha1 + alpha3 \
+ alpha4 + alpha5 + alpha6 + ((h + 12*self.slip_length)*alpha2 + \
40*self.slip_length*alpha4 + \
84*self.slip_length*alpha6)/h))/self.slip_length))\"\>"], "Output",
